---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout sideBarActiveItemID="home">
    <div class="pb-6 mt-5">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Hi, I’m Christina! <span class="bug-home"></span></h1>
        <div class="home-introduction pt-4">
            <p>I’m a Ph.D. student in Computer Science at the <a href="https://www.usc.edu/" class="text-blue-500">University of Southern California</a>, under the supervision of Prof. <a href="https://viterbi-web.usc.edu/~halfond/" class="text-blue-500">William G.J. Halfond</a>. </p>

            <p>I’m curious about where software goes wrong—and how we can catch it before it does. My research interests include <b>software testing</b>, <b>program analysis</b>, <b>AI agents for security</b>, and <b>web services</b>, with the goal of making software more secure and reliable.
            Beyond research, I’m a mom to little Ariadni, who keeps me curious in entirely new ways—and occasionally helps me explore research questions at unusual hours.</p>
            <p>You can read more about my background in my <a class="text-blue-500" href="/CChaniotaki_CV.pdf">CV</a>.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div>
        <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-2">Latest updates</div>
    </div>
    <div class="time-line-container original-timeline grid gap-4 mb-10">
